@startuml hix-flujo-publicacion
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Verdana
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #999999
  ParticipantBorderColor #555555
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  GroupBorderColor #999999
}

participant "Custodio" as K
participant "Authorization\nServer" as AS
participant "Record Locator\nService" as RLS
participant "Registro de\nidentidad maestra" as PMIR
participant "Document\nRegistry" as REG

K -> K : almacena el documento\nen su repositorio
K -> AS : [ITI-71] Get Access Token
AS --> K : token (audiencia: RLS)
K -> RLS : [ITI-65] Provide Document Bundle\n(metadatos, URL relativa) [ITI-72]
RLS -> AS : [ITI-102] Introspect Token
AS --> RLS : activo, organización, propósito
RLS -> RLS : custodio = organización del token\nURL relativa\netiqueta de confidencialidad presente
RLS -> PMIR : [ITI-83] paciente local → identidad maestra
PMIR --> RLS : identidad maestra
RLS -> AS : [HIX-1] Token Exchange\n(resource = Document Registry)
AS --> RLS : JWT (aud = registro, sub = custodio,\nact = RLS, vida ≤ 120 s)
RLS -> REG : [ITI-65] puntero con\nsubject = identidad maestra [ITI-72]
REG --> RLS : 200
RLS --> K : 200
alt la comunidad rechaza la publicación
  RLS --> K : 4xx con OperationOutcome
  K -> K : revierte el documento local
end
note over K, REG : Cada llamada del RLS a un servicio central o a un custodio va precedida de un intercambio [HIX-1] a nombre del solicitante.\nCada actor registra sus eventos [ITI-20] bajo el identificador de correlación de la operación.
@enduml
